quote-text: A community that remembers its past is better prepared to shape its future.
quote-author: Eleanor Hartley
quote-source: Opening address, 1962
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki

Eleanor Hartley founded our society in 1962 with eleven members and a borrowed filing cabinet. Her opening address set out the mission we still follow today: collect, preserve and share the stories of everyone who has called this place home.
